    "body": "<p>Learn about the questions feature included in Klaviyo Reviews, which allows your team to answer and display user-submitted product questions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01H9THG591VGPKERTTN8KNDQ86\">About questions</h2>\n<p>Collect and review user-submitted product questions and enable your team to display answers on the relevant product page. When you add a reviews widget to your product pages, a <em>Questions</em> tab is included by default. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717418203675\" alt=\"Reviews questions tab\" width=\"723\" height=\"94\"></p>\n<p>Site visitors can click the <strong>Ask a question</strong> button to submit a question and provide their name and email as contact information. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01H9THG591KTRXSCXZ88WXC2RM\">How to view questions</h2>\n<p>To see the questions that have been submitted: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select <strong>Reviews</strong> in the Klaviyo sidebar. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Q&amp;A</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717418207259\" alt=\"The questions tab\" width=\"408\" height=\"116\">\n</li>\n<li>Note any unanswered questions, which are marked as <em>Pending</em>. Questions your team has already reviewed will either be marked as <em>Answered</em> or <em>Rejected</em>.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717390949659\" alt=\"An example review quesiton\" width=\"466\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01H9THG591V6APVF5915MMH8V2\">How to answer questions</h2>\n<p>To answer customer questions, navigate to <strong>Reviews &gt; Q&amp;A</strong>, then click <strong>Answer</strong> next to any unanswered questions. Note that answering a question will notify the person who submitted a question via the email address they provided.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to share your answer directly with the person who asked it, click the <em>i</em> icon in the question card. From this page, you can locate their email address and contact them directly. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717418205595\" alt=\"The more info page for a question\" width=\"391\" height=\"159\"></p>\n<p>If a question is inappropriate or you don’t want to display it on your site, click <strong>Reject</strong>. Rejected questions are stored in the <em>Q&amp;A</em> tab and are not visible to site visitors. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01H9TJ5HNPY9ZDEY6WGTFMQZM1\">Get notified about new questions</h2>\n<p>Set up email notifications whenever someone asks a question about one of your products. </p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Enabling notifications for new questions means you’ll also be notified whenever someone submits a review. It is not possible to subscribe exclusively to product question notifications. </p>\n</div>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab in Klaviyo.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Reviews settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Publishing rules and notifications</strong>.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Notifications</em>, check the box next to <em>Pending activity (reviews and Q&amp;As)</em>.</li>\n<li>Choose a frequency (immediately, daily, or weekly) and delivery timing.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717418211739\" alt=\"reviews notifications settings\" width=\"407\" height=\"323\">\n</li>\n<li>Choose one or more notification recipients from your list of account users. Notifications will be sent to them when someone submits a review or product question.<br>\n\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Notifications can only be sent to account users. If you’d like to send notifications to someone you don’t see in the dropdown, <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360053547071\">invite them to join your Klaviyo account</a>. </p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Optionally, check the box next to <em>Weekly stats summary</em> to receive a weekly report on your product reviews. This can be sent to a different user (or users) than those who are selected for review notifications.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save changes</strong>.</li>\n</ol>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
